    /**
     * Securely obtains a {@link Document} from the message body.
     *
     * <p>This method mitigates XXE attacks by parsing XML input with a
     * {@link DocumentBuilderFactory} that has external entity resolution disabled
     * and DOCTYPE declarations disallowed. The returned object is always a
     * {@link Document} (or the original body if no conversion is required).</p>
