     *
     * <p>This method performs strict validation of the input strings to guard against
     * malformed data that could otherwise cause {@link ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException}
     * or {@link NumberFormatException}. If either argument is {@code null},
     * does not contain exactly three dot‑separated numeric components, or contains
     * non‑numeric characters, an {@link IllegalArgumentException} is thrown.</p>
     *
